{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20063","headline":"寄洺州李大夫 · 孟郊","name":"寄洺州李大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自从蓟师反，中国事纷纷。\n儒道一失所，贤人多在军。\n鸟巢忧迸射，鹿耳骇惊闻。\n剑折唯恐匣，弓贪不让勳。\n方知省事将，动必谢前羣。\n鹳阵常先罢，鱼符最晚分。\n步闲洺水曲，笑激太行云。\n诗叟未相识，竹儿争见君。\n殷勤越谈说，记尽古风文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}